sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Client
    participant Core as ExpenseCoreService
    participant Repo as MetadataRepository (Interface)
    participant Store as StorageStrategy (Interface)
    participant Rule as RuleEngine

    Note over UI, Core: Upload File (Generic Storage)

    UI->>Core: upload(entryID, INVOICE, inputStream)
    activate Core

    Core->>Repo: findById(entryID)
    Repo-->>Core: Entry (path="/2024/Dentista")

    Note right of Core: Logic: Resolve Naming
    Core->>Rule: getNaming(INVOICE)
    Rule-->>Core: "Fattura.pdf"

    Note right of Core: Storage Agnostic Save
    Core->>Store: saveStream("/2024/Dentista", "Fattura.pdf", input)
    Store-->>Core: OK

    Core->>Repo: updateSlot(entryID, INVOICE, meta)

    Core->>Rule: validate(entry)
    Rule-->>Core: NEW_STATUS

    Core->>Repo: updateStatus(entryID, NEW_STATUS)

    Core-->>UI: Success(NEW_STATUS)
    deactivate Core